{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick","id":1088203,"title":"The Old Packmate is a secret Nuwisha trick...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-05T04:48:02-07:00","id":1088203,"title":"The Old Packmate is a secret Nuwisha trick...","content":"So I'm going to have my Wild West game have two NPC packmembers, and one of them I am thinking of being Secretly a Nuwisha posing as a Wendigo Ragabash. So they mention this is a common Nuwisha trick even into the Modern Age.<br /> <br /> But how will I go about doing it. They are going to start as a Pack before their rite of the Totem, Will the Nuwisha just use that Tag along gift, I forget who learns it maybe Ragabashes? So will the Pack form, but the Nuwisha doesn't add to the Totem Background?<br /> <br /> Their Coyote shifting seems like it would smell hella weird to normal Garou, what tricks do they have to cover up they are a Friggin Coyote rather then a scrawny wolf?<br /> <br /> The Pack is a mix Uktena Fianna pack, so I'm wondering what the end game will be for this Nuwisha, Broken Wind? I'm thinking maybe it will be a 2nd Rank, that way Broken Wind can pose as a survivor of a Pure Tribe/Wyrmbringer Sept War. He, or maybe I'll have it a she yeah why not balance the sexes nicely, could plan to try to help heal the tribal divide of the Garou Nation with this pack. 2nd Rank isn't too much more experienced then Cliath, and the NPC posing as a survivor of a wiped out pack means she can get away with not leading the pack and more supporting a new pack<br /> <br /> How Long I wonder should I keep it up?<br /> <br /> Has anyone used this trope yet in your games?<br /> <br /> And Nuwisha don't make Metis... and can breed with Garou... so how much shenanigans could she get into trying to seduce Garou?! That seems like something that should be mentioned more with Nuwisha, considering their Patron's famous Libido! Garou may take it bitterly being scared into thinking they made a metis, but Nuwisha could pull it off as performing a seducer role to test their loyalty to the Litany.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T13:26:00-07:00","id":1088456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I forget who learns it maybe Ragabashes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Bone Gnawers, but I don't think it's a closely guarded secret. If you'd like to cross-check a Gift easily, check out the <a href=\"http://www.wyrmfoe.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.wyrmfoe.com/</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> So will the Pack form, but the Nuwisha doesn't add to the Totem Background?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nay, he'd have a Personal (Coyote) Totem, as usual. Play a reluctant guy, who won't integrate into the Pact, because of a ritual/spiritual/social reason, but would like to help.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their Coyote shifting seems like it would smell hella weird to normal Garou, what tricks do they have to cover up they are a Friggin Coyote rather then a scrawny wolf?</div> </div> </div> </div>Play as a Metis, whose &quot;deformity&quot; is the lack of Hispo, and never use the coyote form. The Lupus &amp; Sendeh are almost the same. Use Gifts to change / hide the smell. PROFIT!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How Long I wonder should I keep it up??</div> </div> </div> </div>A long as it's funny for the Nuwisha. They would leave as soon as it's boring.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone used this trope yet in your games?</div> </div> </div> </div>I, for sure, and I strongly advise to read and assimilate the Nuwisha Breedbook. It's one of the most complex breed to play, if you'd like the leering idiot type.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And Nuwisha don't make Metis... and can breed with Garou... so how much shenanigans could she get into trying to seduce Garou?!</div> </div> </div> </div>This would blew her cover for sure &amp; a bunch of blood-mad Garou would try to hunt her down (they don't forgive easily). And what would be the gain in a Nuwisha's perspective? Breed another glory-mongrel asshole? And of course the Garou would be highly ostracized. Maybe he'd be a Ronin faster, than the baby borns.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> to test their loyalty to the Litany.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nuwishas don't give a f*ck about the Garou's Litany. Their pranks are more focused on practicality. Also what would a Garou learn from it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":562,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","user":"Lachdanan","date":". 05-05-2017, 04:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T20:57:50-07:00","id":1088615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick#post1088203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And Nuwisha don't make Metis... and can breed with Garou... so how much shenanigans could she get into trying to seduce Garou?! That seems like something that should be mentioned more with Nuwisha, considering their Patron's famous Libido! Garou may take it bitterly being scared into thinking they made a metis, but Nuwisha could pull it off as performing a seducer role to test their loyalty to the Litany.</div> </div> </div> </div>This sounds far more likely to be something attempted by a Bitter Grin than a Gaian Nuwisha. Undermining the Litany is not a good lesson to teach.<br /> <br /> Also it would likely blow her cover if the Garou didn't go along with it- then what is the Nuwisha going to say? &quot;Oh well, it is ok, since I am not a Garou, this was just a test! Heehehhehe!&quot; Whether the seduction is successful or not, it seems to come back to bite the Nuwisha.<br /> <br /> The other problem is fighting- Nuwisha lack rage, so unless you let her have the high-level gift that basically allows for extra actions like rage, she will not be able to keep up or pull her weight in combat. Her slowness is likely going to raise questions... <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T00:50:08-07:00","id":1088648,"title":"","content":"Nuwisha do Care about the Litany, just not in the way the Garou do. They want all the Shifters to do what Gaia intended, and the Litany was literally handed down by Gaia herself.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick?p=1088615#post1088615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This sounds far more likely to be something attempted by a Bitter Grin than a Gaian Nuwisha. Undermining the Litany is not a good lesson to teach.<br /> <br /> Also it would likely blow her cover if the Garou didn't go along with it- then what is the Nuwisha going to say? &quot;Oh well, it is ok, since I am not a Garou, this was just a test! Heehehhehe!&quot; Whether the seduction is successful or not, it seems to come back to bite the Nuwisha.<br /> <br /> The other problem is fighting- Nuwisha lack rage, so unless you let her have the high-level gift that basically allows for extra actions like rage, she will not be able to keep up or pull her weight in combat. Her slowness is likely going to raise questions...<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well the idea isn't the Nuwisha doesn't try to get the Garou to disobey the Litany, just choose a Target they know who really would break the Litany, probably some Ass who is screwing over the Whole Garou Nation by being bullheaded, Like a Wendigo willing to sabotage Peace Talks by openly trying to murder a Silverfang Elder, or a Shadowlord betraying an allied tribe just so they can make a Sept Coup.<br /> <br /> The Nuwisha doesn't even have to be really pregnant just fake pregnancy as Garou Garou mating is virtually a guaranteed baby making action. It could be right when the Nuwisha plans to depart the pact.<br /> <br /> Also note Nuwisha aren't Perfect Jim Carrey Doctor Dooms, Coyote was Brilliant but he very often got screwed over by thinking with his groin. So it very much seems appropriate for a Nuwisha to justify a reason to pork someone they find attractive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T08:27:30-07:00","id":1088762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick?p=1088648#post1088648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nuwisha do Care about the Litany, just not in the way the Garou do. They want all the Shifters to do what Gaia intended, and the Litany was literally handed down by Gaia herself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick?p=1088648#post1088648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also note Nuwisha aren't Perfect Jim Carrey Doctor Dooms, Coyote was Brilliant but he very often got screwed over by thinking with his groin. So it very much seems appropriate for a Nuwisha to justify a reason to pork someone they find attractive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Coyote =/= all Coyote legends, and individual Nuwisha are not Coyote (the totem or mythological character) either. Maybe use the Native legends to inform the totem's character, sure, but the WtA Coyote hasn't necessarily done all those things in the Coyote story, or maybe the humans badly butchered some version of the truth. In any case, any given Nuwisha isn't the wily legend that is old Coyote. Nuwisha may not succeed all the time, but the character having sketchy plans that fall apart because they are too horny sounds really stupid. They'd be shitty at their job if teaching constantly involved backfiring mishaps or outright failure, because that sort of stuff will get 'em killed and/or obscure whatever lesson they might teach.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T12:44:30-07:00","id":1089317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1088203-the-old-packmate-is-a-secret-nuwisha-trick?p=1088762#post1088762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe some of it's pieces. Hoever it's sanctioned by Spirits/Tribal Ancestors.<br /> <br /> Let me come out with examples:<br /> Combat the Wyrm! Can ya imagine Garou digging out earthworms on the Primordial Earth before the fall of the Triat? In the time of the fall Gaia was in slumber / powerless.<br /> <br /> Don't eat city-monkeys. Was invented after (!) the Concord by Stargazers...<br /> <br /> The Veil shall not be... Another &quot;new&quot; invention.<br /> <br /> Yes, Nuwisha would like to kick back every Changer into their rightful place. The Litany may be not the best source to find out, what is / was their ancient role.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}